# Post-image probe for 0010-boards-seeed-xiao-ble-uf2-runner.patch
#
# Each non-comment line here is a string that MUST exist in a file the patch
# touches once the fix is in. The re-applier (esp-port/apply-zephyr-patches.sh)
# uses these to decide "already applied" instead of guessing from patch exit
# codes, which cannot tell "already applied" from "context drifted".
#
# Written by hand, because no added line works for this patch (see the two
# cases below). Every line was checked against the v4.5.0 tag and against
# v4.5.0+coban-fixes:
#   - a plain line is present on the branch; if it is also in the tag it is only
#     an anchor, there to fail if the file is renamed or restructured;
#   - a line starting with '!' is a string the fix REMOVES and must be gone; it
#     was checked to exist in the tag, so its absence is real evidence.
board_runner_args(pyocd "--target=nrf52840" "--frequency=4000000")
!board_runner_args(uf2 "--board-id=Seeed_XIAO_nRF52840_Sense")
